{"Team permission check requires user to be both team admin AND team owner simultaneously (isTeamAdmin && isTeamOwner), which is stricter than intended and rejects legitimate team admins or team owners": 0.9568815231323242, "sendAddGuestsEmails() classifies guests using newGuests.includes(attendee.email) which fails on casing/format mismatches, causing newly added emails to get the wrong template and existing attendees to get add-guests notifications": 0.5691474676132202, "UI sends string[] for guests while TRPC schema requires guest objects with email, name, timeZone, phoneNumber, and language fields, causing mutation to be rejected by input validation": 0.11828375607728958, "Organizer email subject uses this.calEvent.attendees[0].name which depends on mutable attendee ordering and throws if attendee list is empty": 0.5180278420448303, "Add guests action is injected into booking.actionButtons without checking booking.eventType.disableGuests, bypassing the existing action gating that hides this option when guests are disabled": 0.9026692509651184}